      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d suggest we pass true here. This parameter (dumpAsHex) controls whether we write the path control points as regular floating point values (1.0f) or exact hexadecimal bit-patterns (0x3f800000). If you\u0027re trying to replicate a tricky bug, the latter can be important - the non-hex version doesn\u0027t always print enough digits to perfectly round-trip.",
